      "sourceTextSha256": "eb8fe1f6bedd7883e9b869b49c2145d5184203cf552dc912d60ccea398d2c012",
      "text": "Day 4 · After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to Foz do Iguaçu; arrival and transfer to the hotel, then a tour of the Brazilian side of the falls. On the border of Brazil, Argentina and Paraguay, within a national park of unique flora and fauna, 275 waterfalls, each with its own name, crash into the canyon of the Devil’s Throat; their name means “big water” in Guarani. The contrast between the calm, almost lazy river above the falls and the torrents boiling into the gorge below is stunning: you could watch this spectacle for hours. Optional: the Macuco Safari or the Bird Park (see Optional excursions).",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1XC7SzKzCjT4JKLqQFnqOC9dWFebKT9E1",
