      "sourceTextSha256": "8b6ab0596ad8cbc3a2fbf597547fbb09efa95010fd951370b61ad36999c1661f",
      "text": "Day 5 · After breakfast, cross the Tancredo Neves Bridge over the Iguazu River to the Argentine side of the falls, which is different from the Brazilian one: here you stand under and above the falls at the same time, feeling the power of the falling water very close to you, and enjoy the national park around this astonishing beauty. See the source of the Devil’s Throat.",
